message: If you use this software, cite it with the metadata below.
type: software
title: Agrivoltaic garden model
authors:
  - family-names: Klingelhofer
    given-names: Peter
version: 0.0.0
date-released: '2026-09-12'
repository-code: https://github.com/peterklingelhofer/agrivoltaic-garden-model
url: https://garden.peterklingelhofer.com
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A site-specific model of the light a solar array leaves on the ground, and of which crops that
  light still supports. It reads the sun, weather and soil at a real address, simulates how much
  light reaches the ground once panels are over it, and computes which crops still suit each bed
  and what to plant when. Every quantitative claim carries its source.
